   pipeline finished in 7.68 s

## 4. Untested code fails the coverage gate
   concept: the unit job runs vitest --coverage; vitest.config.ts sets thresholds (lines, statements, functions 90%, branches 85%) and vitest exits non-zero below them, so the job and the pipeline fail. This function passes lint and tsc but has no test
